{{also|Persona non grata}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} {{term|persona||person|lang=la}} + {{term|non||not|lang=la}} + {{term|grata|lang=la}} (from {{term|gratus||acceptable|lang=la}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/pə(ɹ)ˈsəʊnə nɒn ˈɡɹɑːtə/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[persona]] [[non]] [[grata]]|personae non gratae}}

# A person who is not [[welcome]], especially a [[diplomat]] in a [[foreign]] [[country]].

====Usage notes====
Sometimes incorrectly pluralized as [[personas non grata]].

